  "bodyHash": "86a28dcd97690a8f",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。用心打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於本模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Mineral Chance 是一個旨在讓採礦變得更加有趣的模組。在挖掘石頭類方塊後，它會增加隨機獲得礦物的機率。在主世界中，這些石頭方塊包括<strong><em>石頭、安山岩、閃長岩、花崗岩、凝灰岩與深板岩</em></strong>。在下界則是<em><strong>下界岩、玄武岩與黑石</strong></em>。<br><br>預設情況下，獲得礦物的機率為 1/50。主世界的礦物包含<em><strong>鑽石、鐵粒、金粒、青金石、紅石與綠寶石</strong></em>。下界的礦物則包含<em><strong>石英、金粒與下界合金碎片（1.16+）</strong></em>。使用絲綢之觸挖掘將不會掉落礦物。<br><br>所有礦物掉落的機率相同。發現隨機礦物時的提示訊息可在設定檔中修改或關閉。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"相依性\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum 的 RPG 套件組\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>extraMineralChanceOnOverworldStoneBreak</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 0.02, 最小 0, 最大 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">挖掘主世界石頭方塊時掉落礦物的機率。預設為 1/50。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>extraMineralChanceOnNetherStoneBreak</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 0.01, 最小 0, 最大 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">挖掘下界石頭方塊時掉落礦物的機率。預設為 1/100。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableOverworldMinerals</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，在主世界挖掘石頭方塊有機率掉落主世界礦物。這些礦物包含鑽石、金粒、鐵粒、青金石、紅石與綠寶石。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableNetherMinerals</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，在下界挖掘石頭方塊有機率掉落下界礦物。這些礦物包含石英、金粒與下界合金碎片（1.16+）。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>disableMineralDropsWithSilkTouch</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，使用絲綢之觸附魔挖掘的方塊將不會掉落礦物。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>sendMessageOnMineralFind</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，當發現礦物時，會向挖掘該方塊的玩家發送提示訊息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>foundMineralMessage</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 \"You've found a mineral hidden in the block!\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">當 'sendMessageOnMineralFind' 啟用時，發現隱藏礦物後發送給玩家的訊息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>ignoreFakePlayers</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，若玩家為虛假玩家（例如由模組模擬操作時），則不會掉落礦物。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/mineral-chance/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"606\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>在主世界中，當 '<em>extraMineralChanceOnOverworldStoneBreak</em>' 設定為 0.5 時的實際效果：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/mineral-chance/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"534\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>在下界中，當 '<em>extraMineralChanceOnNetherStoneBreak</em>' 設定為 0.5 時的實際效果：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/mineral-chance/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"534\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以自由在任何整合包中使用此模組，只要下載來源仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內即可。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於我無法在眾多獨立的模組頁面中追蹤留言，因此已關閉評論功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 倉庫</a>。感謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
